      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Acid reflux, high blood pressure, and high cholesterol.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:32",
      "end_timestamp": "02:37",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[0]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[1]",
        "medical_history.past_medical_history[2]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Do you have a family history of throat or neck cancer?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:39",
      "end_timestamp": "02:46",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.family_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "My father had cancer of the voice box, he smoked eighty a day.",
      "start_timestamp": "02:48",
      "end_timestamp": "02:56",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.family_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "And do you smoke or drink?",
      "start_timestamp": "02:58",
      "end_timestamp": "03:02",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]",
        "medical_history.social_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "I gave it up in 2015, after the heart scare. And a few pints at the weekend.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:03",
      "end_timestamp": "03:14",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.social_history[0]",
        "medical_history.social_history[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "But the hoarseness and the sore throat for that long, in someone with a smoking history, need a proper look with a camera. I'd say this could be reflux irritating the voice box, but I can't rule out something more serious, like a growth.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:07",
      "end_timestamp": "04:29",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_assessment[0]",
        "clinical_assessment[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I don't think so, but I must be sure. I'd like to refer you urgently to the ENT clinic, to have a camera passed through your nose to see your voice box.",
      "start_timestamp": "04:33",
      "end_timestamp": "04:51",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "In the meantime, keep taking the omeprazole, avoid late meals, alcohol and spicy food, and don't clear your throat or whisper.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:04",
      "end_timestamp": "05:14",
      "supports": [
        "clinical_actions[3]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd also like a chest X-ray, as a precaution, because of your smoking history.",
      "start_timestamp": "05:20",
      "end_timestamp": "05:28",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]",
        "clinical_actions[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "I'd like to see you again in three weeks, once ENT have seen you.",
